From a0a810833a6a9ecd54f2baced250c00f68eb7f3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Ashforde=20O=C3=9C?= <ashfordegithub@cbaweja.org>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 18:32:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(desktop): ship icon.ico and icon.icns, so the Windows
 resource and the macOS bundle build

tauri-build needs icons/icon.ico to make the Windows resource file; the
macOS bundle takes icons/icon.icns. Both are made from icons/icon.png
(512 px) and listed in tauri.conf.json bundle.icon.
---
 apps/desktop/src-tauri/icons/icon.icns | Bin 0 -> 440468 bytes
 apps/desktop/src-tauri/icons/icon.ico  | Bin 0 -> 34656 bytes
 apps/desktop/src-tauri/tauri.conf.json |   4 +++-
 3 files changed, 3 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 apps/desktop/src-tauri/icons/icon.icns
 create mode 100644 apps/desktop/src-tauri/icons/icon.ico

diff --git a/apps/desktop/src-tauri/icons/icon.icns b/apps/desktop/src-tauri/icons/icon.icns
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..de3693c48bd8566b80d20a6d4ce1cd542e013f26
GIT binary patch
